  <data name="label1.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>This is Classic 7's first time use setup utility.
Once you've completed all the steps, your system will restart to apply some finishing touches.

This wizard will let you customise your:

· Branding: Choose your preferred style of branding
· Browser Style: Choose preferred style of Firefox
</value>
